@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Get current records snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/records/current

### Confirm abnormal
POST {{baseUrl}}/records/confirm-abnormal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "region": "北侧入湖口",
  "confirmer": "巡检员A12"
}

### Record action
POST {{baseUrl}}/records/record-action
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "measures": "已加密采样并通知上游闸站复核来水情况。"
}
